      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "你知道北部火力發電廠嗎？日本人來台灣時，在北部留下很多建設。二戰結束，他們走得太急。水泥、管道、廠房、坡道，還有半完成的地基，都留在海邊山坡上。後來的人只把這些當廢墟、遺跡，或地方鬼故事。幾乎沒有人知道——當時日本人還留下了一些東西。",
      "startMillis": 0,
      "durationMillis": 22000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-01a",
      "panelId": "shot-01-tide-check",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "2026年7月，颱風巴威還在海上。陸塵行照著潮汐表，估計還有兩小時。",
      "startMillis": 23000,
      "durationMillis": 5000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-01b",
      "panelId": "shot-01-tide-check",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "還來得及。退潮窗口還在。",
      "startMillis": 29000,
      "durationMillis": 3000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-02a",
      "panelId": "shot-02-strange-find",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "海蝕平台上，有不該出現的痕跡。",
      "startMillis": 33000,
      "durationMillis": 3500
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-02b",
      "panelId": "shot-02-strange-find",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "這不是天然岩層……誰在這裡接過東西？",
      "startMillis": 37000,
      "durationMillis": 4500
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-03",
      "panelId": "shot-03-overfocus",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "他看得太久。好奇心壓過了時間。",
      "startMillis": 42000,
      "durationMillis": 4000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-04a",
      "panelId": "shot-04-water-rises",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "海水比表上漲得快。",
      "startMillis": 47000,
      "durationMillis": 3000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-04b",
      "panelId": "shot-04-water-rises",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "不對——這不是平常漲潮。",
      "startMillis": 51000,
      "durationMillis": 3500
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-05",
      "panelId": "shot-05-return-blocked",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "回不去了。",
      "startMillis": 55000,
      "durationMillis": 2500
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-06",
      "panelId": "shot-06-wind-worsens",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "巴威的外圍環流壓上來，浪勢一次比一次重。",
      "startMillis": 58000,
      "durationMillis": 4500
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-07",
      "panelId": "shot-07-sky-darkens",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "白天像被擰短了一截。",
      "startMillis": 63000,
      "durationMillis": 3000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-08",
      "panelId": "shot-08-no-signal",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "……沒訊號。",
      "startMillis": 67000,
      "durationMillis": 2000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-09a",
      "panelId": "shot-09-hillside-retreat",
      "voiceId": "voice-narrator",
      "characterId": "narrator",
      "text": "唯一能躲的地方，在山坡上——日治時期留下的廢棄構造物。",
      "startMillis": 70000,
      "durationMillis": 5000
    },
    {
      "cueId": "audio-09b",
      "panelId": "shot-09-hillside-retreat",
      "voiceId": "voice-lu-chenxing",
      "characterId": "char-lu-chenxing",
      "text": "愛醬，跟我走。上面那棟……至少能擋風。",
      "startMillis": 76000,
      "durationMillis": 4500
    }
  ],
